==Battleground==
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 6.67~16 seconds<sup>200f~480f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*100 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. If you have trouble with the Teacher Bears, bring ranged attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Since it's in [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]], With a Ton of Padding is likely a reference to [[wikipedia:Paddington Bear|Paddington Bear]], a children's book character by [[wikipedia:Michael Bond|Michael Bond]].

